flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> COLLECT[Collect Crop Symptoms\n& Metadata]

    COLLECT --> DIAGNOSE[Diagnose Crop Disease\nRAG Search + Self-RAG + LLM]

    DIAGNOSE --> ROUTE_DIAGNOSE{Grounded Diagnosis?}

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Diagnostic Routing & Retry Loop
    %% ==============================================================

    ROUTE_DIAGNOSE -->|Grounded| PROPOSE[Propose Treatment\nChemical Whitelist & Equipment Lookup]
    ROUTE_DIAGNOSE -->|Ungrounded / Retries < 3| DIAGNOSE
    ROUTE_DIAGNOSE -->|Retries >= 3| FAILURE[Handle Failure\nOpen Ticket in Tickets Table]

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Treatment Whitelist & Equipment Resolution
    %% ==============================================================

    PROPOSE --> ROUTE_PROPOSE{Proposal Valid?}
    ROUTE_PROPOSE -->|Error / No Match / No Sprayer| FAILURE
    ROUTE_PROPOSE -->|Valid Treatment| HITL_CHECK[HITL Check\nCheck Chemicals.requires_signoff]

    %% ==============================================================
    %% HITL Gate & Human Sign-off
    %% ==============================================================

    HITL_CHECK --> HITL_GATE{Requires Sign-off?}
    HITL_GATE -->|No| FARMER_WAIT[Await Farmer Confirmation]
    HITL_GATE -->|Yes| HITL_PAUSE{{Wait for Admin Sign-off\nCrop_HITL_Tasks Interrupt}}

    HITL_PAUSE --> ADMIN_DECISION{Admin Decision}
    ADMIN_DECISION -->|Approved| FARMER_WAIT
    ADMIN_DECISION -->|Rejected| PROPOSE

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Farmer Confirmation
    %% ==============================================================

    FARMER_WAIT --> WAIT_FARMER{{Wait for Farmer Reply\nFarmer Confirmation Interrupt}}

    WAIT_FARMER --> FARMER_DECISION{Farmer Confirmed?}
    FARMER_DECISION -->|Declined| CLOSE[Close Case]
    FARMER_DECISION -->|Confirmed| EXECUTE[Execute Treatment\nDispatch Sprayer]

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Treatment Execution & Dispatch
    %% ==============================================================

    EXECUTE --> ROUTE_EXECUTE{Dispatch Succeeded?}
    ROUTE_EXECUTE -->|Dispatch Failed| FAILURE
    ROUTE_EXECUTE -->|Treatment Started| WAIT_OBSERVATION{{Wait for Follow-up Observation\nPost-Treatment Interrupt}}

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Treatment Outcome & Monitoring Cycle
    %% ==============================================================

    WAIT_OBSERVATION --> EVALUATE[Evaluate Treatment Result]

    EVALUATE --> OUTCOME{Treatment Outcome?}

    OUTCOME -->|Recovered| CLOSE
    OUTCOME -->|Improved| WAIT_OBSERVATION
    OUTCOME -->|Worsened| RE_DIAGNOSE[Re-Diagnose\nAppend Treatment History]
    OUTCOME -->|Invalid Observation| FAILURE

    %% Re-diagnosis loop back into diagnostic node
    RE_DIAGNOSE --> DIAGNOSE

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Terminal States
    %% ==============================================================

    FAILURE --> END([End])
    CLOSE --> END
